      "anchor": "[ARSHY:REQ-001]",
      "body": "The plotter shall accept and display 2D Cartesian equations in explicit `y = f(x)` or implicit `F(x,y) = 0` form, using numeric constants, `x` and `y`, parentheses, addition (`+`), subtraction (`-`), multiplication (`*`), division (`/`), and exponentiation (`^`). *(S1)*",
